--- Source: P3109/D1 4.8; 4.14, printed page 31; 58.
fmod P3109-EXTERNAL-SIGNATURE is
  including P3109-XREAL .
  including P3109-FORMAT-CORE .
  op externalDecode : Format Int ~> XReal .
  op externalEncode : Format XReal ~> Nat .
  op externalDatum : Format XReal ~> Bool .
  op externalBound : Format String ~> Nat .
endfm
